# Every diagram type

One small block per type the crate draws — the seventeen native types and the four chart aliases. The constructive DOM test, the PDF page test and the CloudSurf web walk share this file: a type that draws on the web draws here, through every sink.

::diagram[type=architecture title="Architecture"]
web: Web
api: API
db: Postgres
web -> api: HTTPS
api <-> db: SQL
::

::diagram[type=erd title="Schema"]
users: id pk, email unique
docs: id pk, owner_id fk
users 1--* docs: owns
::

::diagram[type=flowchart title="Flow"]
start [terminator]: Start
check [diamond]: Valid?
save: Persist
start -> check
check -> save: yes
check -> start: no
::

::diagram[type=sequence title="Sequence with a return"]
actor user: User
actor api: API
user -> api: POST /login
activate api
api --> user: 200 OK
deactivate api
::

